{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No health bars.<br>No damage numbers.<br>Just physics, knockback, and chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dropcore</strong> is a fast-paced 2D arena game where the goal is simple:<br><strong>throw your opponents off the map before they do the same to you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matches are quick, messy, and skill-driven. Positioning, movement, and timing matter more than raw shooting. One wrong step and you\u2019re gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features <strong>6 game modes</strong> and <strong>6 different maps</strong>, built for nonstop action and constant momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>online with 2-4 players</strong>, or jump into <strong>offline matches against bots</strong> to practice, warm up, or just mess around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dropcore includes multiple weapon types, each with its own recoil, fire rate, and knockback feel.<br>On top of that, <strong>passive and active abilities</strong> let you push opponents, escape danger, or completely flip the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built and maintained by a <strong>solo indie developer</strong>, Dropcore focuses on tight controls, clear mechanics, and replayable chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy fast arena combat where movement wins fights and physics decides everything - welcome to <strong>Dropcore</strong>.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Gravity Wins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3726110/080d9a43822b18d474e0be2a98390c7ea76ba49f.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3726110?t=1765919054","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726110/629eff7b3c8b2535f04ff6fcfb8e16d0f55b0ac6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765919054","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726110/91bb05